alse","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":10810,"output":1175,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_IW5uVIn758tTLjXsr3NsBRVL","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Atoken-status-unspecified::entry%3Aget-shared","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"unknown"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared entry, the outcome is conditional on the supplied token's runtime status. For a token returned by getActiveMemoShare, the handler fetches exactly the memo identified by the share record, rejects missing, non-active, or SPACE memos with NOT_FOUND, builds the anonymous read context with that share's memo ID, and returns NOT_FOUND if the read decision is denied. Given the stated premise that a resolving token's associated memo is active, private, non-SPACE, and has a valid creator, the visible share-specific branch applies: the share ID matches the memo ID and the memo is not SPACE, so the share grants access to that exact memo despite the caller being anonymous; the handler then proceeds to construct and return the memo, subject to the separately visible reaction, attachment, and conversion operations. If the token is absent or expired, getActiveMemoShare returns NOT_FOUND before memo resolution. An inaccessible memo branch is visible in the entry: a missing memo, non-normal memo, SPACE memo, a denied read decision, or a creator-conversion not-found case produces NOT_FOUND. The decisive runtime facts not supplied are whether the requested token exists and whether it is unexpired; observing both would choose between the valid-token path and the invalid/expired NOT_FOUND path. No separate requested memo identity is introduced: the source resolves the memo solely from the share record's MemoID.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo requires no authentication and begins by resolving the supplied share token through the active-share helper.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":175}]},{"id":"f-token-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The active-share helper looks up the share by token UID and rejects a missing or expired share with NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":221,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"After token resolution, the handler retrieves exactly the memo whose ID is stored in the share record.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":178,"endLine":180}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The read decision treats a share as applicable only when its shared memo ID equals the memo ID being checked and the memo is not SPACE; that branch allows the read.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":113,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"f-anonymous-private-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"Without the applicable share branch, an anonymous viewer is denied a private memo, showing why the exact share binding is the decisive authorization condition for the stated private memo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":138,"endLine":145}]},{"id":"f-inaccessible-control","kind":"control","statement":"Within GetSharedMemo, a missing memo, non-normal memo, or SPACE memo is mapped to NOT_FOUND, and a denied read decision is also mapped to NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After an allowed read, the handler converts the memo and returns it; a missing creator during conversion is mapped to NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":203,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"f-creator-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The shared read decision fails closed when the resolved memo has no valid creator.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":95}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied share token resolves to an existing share record.","Whether the resolved share is unexpired at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe the result of the share lookup for the supplied token, including whether a share record exists.","If a share record exists, observe its expiry value and the current evaluation time to determine whether it is expired."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":10810,"output":1175,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":57061.389400000044,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:04:00.445Z"}}
