sing runtime facts are whether the supplied token exists and, if it exists, whether it is unexpired.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo requires no authentication and begins by resolving the supplied share token through the active-share helper.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":175}]},{"id":"f-token-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The active-share helper looks up the share by token UID and returns NOT_FOUND when the share is missing or expired.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":221,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"After token resolution, the handler retrieves the memo whose ID is stored in the share record.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":178,"endLine":180}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The read decision applies a share only when the shared memo ID equals the memo ID being checked and the memo is not SPACE; that branch allows the read.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":113,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"f-private-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"Absent the applicable share branch, an anonymous viewer is denied a private memo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":138,"endLine":145}]},{"id":"f-inaccessible-control","kind":"control","statement":"Within GetSharedMemo, a missing, non-normal, or SPACE memo, or a denied read decision, is returned as NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After an allowed read, the handler converts the memo and returns it; a missing creator during conversion is returned as NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":203,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"f-creator-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The read decision fails closed when the resolved memo lacks a valid creator.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":95}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied share token resolves to an existing share record.","Whether an existing share is unexpired at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe whether the share lookup returns a record for the supplied token.","If a record exists, observe its expiry value together with the evaluation time to determine whether it is unexpired."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":12100,"output":895,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":32339.334499999997,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:04:32.789Z"}}
